[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0836","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0836.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1181","title":"Real Networks RealServer 内存内容泄露漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer 7 及更早版本存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过访问 /admin/includes/ URL 获取 RealServer 内存中的敏感信息，可能包括配置数据、用户凭证等机密内容。该漏洞源于对管理接口目录访问控制不当，攻击者只需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1181"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"建议升级至 RealServer 7.0 以上版本（该版本已修复此漏洞）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置访问控制规则，禁止外部 IP 访问 `/admin/includes/` 路径，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 访问管理后台目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0236.html","http://service.real.com/help/faq/security/memory.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1957","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5538","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20406","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1181","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2000/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1181.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1181.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1181.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0836.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0836.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0836.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0834","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0834.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1180","title":"Oracle 8.x Connection Manager Control 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.1.5 Connection Manager Control 中的 cmctl 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 cmctl 程序提交超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致内存数据被覆盖，从而获取目标系统的提升权限。该漏洞影响 Oracle 8.x 系列版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可实现完全控制受影响系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性损失。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1180"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle 数据库至 9i 或更高版本（Oracle 8.1.5 已停止支持），该漏洞在 Oracle 9.0.1 及之后版本中已修复。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 cmctl 程序的执行权限，仅授权管理员使用：`chmod 750 $ORACLE_HOME/bin/cmctl` 并将属主改为 oracle 用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97474521003453&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1968","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5551","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20411","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1180","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2000/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1180.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1180.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1180.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0834.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0833","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0833.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1177","title":"BB4 Big Brother Network Monitor 文件存在性信息泄露漏洞","description":"Big Brother（BB）网络监控系统 1.5d3 之前版本中的 bb-hist.sh、bb-histlog.sh、bb-hostsvc.sh、bb-rep.sh、bb-replog.sh 及 bb-ack.sh 等多个脚本存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向 HISTFILE 参数指定目标文件路径，探测服务器上任意文件是否存在以及获取用户 ID 信息，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Big Brother 1.5d3 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1177"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"升级 Big Brother 至 1.5d3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HISTFILE 参数导致的文件存在性泄露问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面对 bb-hist.sh、bb-rep.sh 等脚本的访问添加 IP 白名单限制，或移除这些脚本的 Web 可执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0284.html","http://bb4.com/incident.nov21","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1971","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20413","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1177","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc250cf8fdc59c77fa474d34589422db608209f4/2000/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1177.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1177.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1177.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0833.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0833.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0833.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0832","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0832.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1176","title":"YaBB SE 1.5.1 search.pl 目录遍历漏洞","description":"YaBB SE 1.5.1 的 search.pl CGI 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 \"catsearch\" 表单字段中提交 `..`（点点）攻击序列，可绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。此外，该版本 News.php 文件还存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可利用注入获取敏感数据库信息。该漏洞影响 YaBB SE 1.5.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1176"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"升级 YaBB 至 1.5.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 search.pl 中用户输入未经验证即传入 open() 函数导致的目录遍历与任意命令执行漏洞。如无法升级，应移除或禁用 search.pl 脚本，并在 Web 服务器层面限制 CGI 目录的执行权限，同时过滤 catsearch 参数中的 ../ 及 shell 元字符作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0110.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1921","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20387","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1176","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1176.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1176.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0832.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0832.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0832.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0831","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0831.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1175","title":"Jan Hubicka Koules 1.4 Svgalib 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Koules 1.4 的 Svgalib 图形库组件存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向程序提交超长的命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1175"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19Z","remediation":"立即移除 koules.sndsrv.linux 二进制文件的 setuid root 权限：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/local/lib/koules/koules.sndsrv.linux` 或 `chmod 755 /usr/local/lib/koules/koules.sndsrv.linux`。如无需使用该游戏，直接卸载整个 koules 软件包。如需继续使用，改用 X11 版本（不依赖 svgalib 且无需 setuid），或升级到已修复此漏洞的 Koules 1.5 及以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/145823","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1967","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20410","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1175","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1175.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1175.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0831.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0830","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0830.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1174","title":"Ethereal AFS ACL解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Ethereal（现 Wireshark）0.8.13 及更早版本的 AFS ACL 解析器中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长用户名字段的特制 AFS 数据包触发该漏洞，导致目标 Ethereal 进程崩溃或执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需构造恶意网络数据包即可触发，危害较大。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本的 Ethereal 用户，建议升级至更新版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1174"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18Z","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 至 0.8.14 或更高版本（该漏洞在 0.8.14 中修复）。由于 Ethereal 已更名为 Wireshark，建议直接升级至 Wireshark 最新稳定版（当前最新为 4.x 系列）。如无法升级，可在网络边界部署入侵检测规则，拦截包含超长用户名的 AFS 协议流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0251.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000342","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001122a","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-116.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1972","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5557","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20414","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1174","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1174.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1174.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0830.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0828","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0828.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1173","title":"Microsys CyberPatrol 注册信息加密不足致敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsys CyberPatrol 4.0 注册过程中存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该软件对信用卡号仅使用弱加密（简单编码）进行保护，而对其余注册信息完全未加密传输，导致攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量获取用户提交的信用卡号及其他敏感个人信息。攻击条件简单，无需认证即可远程利用，影响用户隐私安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1173"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Microsys CyberPatrol 4.0.4.003/4.0.4.005 版本，该产品已停止安全支持。如必须使用，应在客户端与服务器之间部署 TLS/SSL 加密隧道（如 Stunnel），确保所有注册信息（含信用卡号）通过加密通道传输。同时，在网络边界部署入侵检测系统，监控对 cybercentral.microsys.com 的明文 HTTP POST 请求。推荐迁移至支持强制 HTTPS 通信的现代 Web 内容过滤方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0323.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1977","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20425","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1173","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b7a3f185461ada4598db88be1e2c953e4d2cddec/2000/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1173.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1173.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0828.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0828.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0828.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0827","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0827.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1171","title":"Markus Triska CGIForum 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"tags.<value>CGIForum 1.0 的 cgiforum.pl 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。该脚本在处理\"thesection\"参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，即可通过构造包含\"..\"（点号点号）序列的特制参数值，突破可访问目录的边界，进而读取 Web 服务器上任意目标文件的内容，如系统配置文件、源代码或包含敏感信息的文件，造成敏感数据泄露。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者只要能够访问运行 cgiforum.pl 的 Web 服务即可触发，对机密性造成影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1171"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 CGIForum 至最新版本，或迁移至其他仍在维护的论坛系统。如无法升级，修改 cgiforum.pl 中 thesection 参数处理逻辑，对用户输入进行路径规范化过滤，移除所有 ../ 及 %00 空字节截断字符，仅允许字母数字和下划线组成的合法 section 名称。同时配置 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）禁止 CGI 目录的路径遍历访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0263.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1963","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5553","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20408","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1171","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9ec51bb42a17e0dd0492f440cee3d253cc8275e/2000/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1171.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1171.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0827.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0826","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0826.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1154","title":"BeOS RobinHood 1.1 HTTP服务器 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RobinHood 1.1 Web 服务器中的 RHConsole 组件在处理超长 HTTP 请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 BeOS r5 pro 及更早版本系统发送特制的超长 HTTP 请求，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，利用复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1154"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"RobinHood 1.1 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即停止使用该 Web 服务器，迁移至支持 BeOS 的替代方案（如 Apache 或 lighttpd 的旧版本）。如无法立即替换，可在网络边界防火墙或路由器上配置规则，限制对 TCP 80 端口的请求体长度不超过 4000 字节，并部署入侵检测系统（IDS）规则检测超长 HTTP 请求特征。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20404","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1154","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8eb5179bc94e368fed99f8f208b080aa4b8a56b8/2000/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1154.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/59d57936496f37081433ba541bca8c4d04c17f7f/api/2000/CVE-2000-1154.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0826.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0826.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0826.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0824","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0824.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1147","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 ISAPI 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 的 ISAPI .ASP 解析机制存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在脚本标签的 \"LANGUAGE\" 参数中提交超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 版本，攻击者需具备向目标服务器发送恶意 HTTP 请求的能力，成功利用后可获取服务器控制权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1147"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:15Z","remediation":"立即升级到 IIS 7.5 或更高版本（支持 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019/2022），并应用当前安全更新。无法直接升级的 legacy 系统，请禁用不必要的 ISAPI 扩展，实施严格的输入验证，限制对 ASP 处理页面的访问权限，使用 Windows Firewall 仅允许必要端口，通过 URL 扫描器进行定期安全审计。`'LANGUAGE'` 参数输入长度应限制在合理范围内，避免长字符串攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/143070","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1911","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5510","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20383","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1147","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1147.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1147.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0824.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0824.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0823","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0823.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1144","title":"Recourse ManTrap 根目录Inode信息泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6.1 蜜罐系统中存在 chroot 环境检测漏洞。该软件通过 chroot 机制创建隔离文件系统以隐藏自身运行状态，但 chroot 后根目录 \"/\" 的 inode 编号异常高于正常文件系统。本地攻击者可通过执行 `ls -id /` 等命令检查根目录 inode 值，若发现 inode 编号异常偏高即可判断自身处于 chroot 环境中，从而识别出蜜罐系统的存在。该漏洞影响 ManTrap 1.6.1 版本，攻击者需具有本地 shell 访问权限，利用难度低，可导致蜜罐隐身机制失效。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1144"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 ManTrap 2.0 版本，该版本已修复 chroot 环境 inode 泄露问题。同时，管理员应在部署后额外采取以下缓解措施：在宿主机防火墙层面限制 cage 环境的网络出站流量，将 cage 日志通过安全通道发送至远程日志服务器，并定期监控 cage 内进程列表以检测异常。由于 2.0 版本仍存在 crash 工具可查看 cage 外进程的问题，建议在宿主机上禁用或移除不必要的调试工具，并严格限制 cage 内用户的命令执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1909","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5472","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20381","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1144","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1144.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-1144.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0823.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0823.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0823.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0822","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0822.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1140","title":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 隐藏进程泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 蜜罐系统存在隐藏进程泄露漏洞。由于该版本未能正确隐藏系统内运行的进程信息，攻击者可通过对比 kill 命令的输出结果与 /proc 文件系统中的进程列表，发现两者之间存在差异，从而判断自身处于蜜罐环境之中。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，本地攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，导致蜜罐系统被识别而失效。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1140"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14Z","remediation":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 已于 2000 年代停止维护，官方无补丁可用。建议立即迁移至现代蜜罐方案（如 T-Pot、Cowrie、Honeyd 等），这些方案默认隐藏宿主机进程信息。若必须继续使用 ManTrap，可在系统层通过 LSM（如 SELinux）或自定义内核模块拦截对 /proc 中非蜜罐进程的读取，同时限制攻击者的本地 shell 访问权限以降低暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1908","https://exchange.